cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "MOObject" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'MOObject: multiOmicDataSet object class for MOSuite'
version: 0.4.1.9000
abstract: 'MOObject defines the multiOmicDataSet object class which is used in MOSuite
  for differential RNA-seq and multi-omics analyses. Separating the MOObject class
  definition from MOSuite allows for lightweight installations in downstream workflows.
  See the website for more information: <https://ccbr.github.io/MOObject/>. See the
  MOSuite website for the most comprehensive documentation: <https://ccbr.github.io/MOSuite/>.'
